  * change_iface: delegate monitor mode transitions to con_mode\n\nInstead of manually managing adapter vdev state in the change_iface\npath (which is fragile and crashes when the interface is DOWN before\nconversion), delegate STA<->MONITOR mode transitions to the con_mode\nmechanism. The con_mode path performs a full firmware idle\nshutdown/restart cycle, ensuring clean state initialization.\n\nThis fixes the crash that occurred when:\n1. ifdown wlan0 (STA)\n2. iw dev wlan0 set type monitor  (iff_up=false)\n3. ifup wlan0                  → delayed panic ~1s later

